      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "gender_role_stereotype",
      "label": "Gender Role Stereotype: Domestic Labor Assignment",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the societal expectation that in heterosexual relationships, women are assigned the role of managing household chores and domestic responsibilities, while men are expected to handle other aspects of the relationship or career. This stereotype is used to create humor or sarcasm by questioning who makes the sandwiches, implying the woman is the default answer.",
