      "label": "Mysogynous",
      "description": "The meme perpetuates the stereotype that women are expected to handle domestic chores like making sandwiches, reinforcing traditional gender roles and implying that in a relationship, the woman is the default person to take on household labor. This is a form of misogynous content as it reinforces the idea that women are inherently responsible for domestic tasks.",
